  "title": "Webhooks (encrypted)",
  "summary": "Roqqu POSTs every deposit, send, refund and payment-link event to the webhook URL set in the RAS console.",
  "note": "The body is {\"hash\": \"<hex>\"}: AES-256-CTR ciphertext. Key = the first 32 characters of your API key; IV = the hex value of the x-api-key request header. A body that does not decrypt to JSON is not from Roqqu. Events: token_received, token_sent, token_refunded, payment_link_completed, payment_link_completed_overpaid, payment_link_failed. Dedupe on event_id.",
